	Section:
		Text: Stack
			Style: topic
		Heading 1:
			Text: Line distribution
		Paragraph: With `Wrap items: true` and a `Height` larger than its lines, `Line distribution` says where the lines go. In a row the lines are stacked from top to bottom, so it takes `top` or `bottom`, and in a column, `left` or `right`.
